 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [0.8.2] - 2026-11-19
+
+### Security
+- Fix arbitrary file write (GHSA-m9mq-7m7q-xc6p). `browser_download`'s `save_dir` is now confined under the download root (`~/.browse-mcp/downloads`) and the explicit `path` of `browser_save_state` / `browser_load_state` under `~/.browse-mcp/state`. Absolute paths and `..` escapes are rejected, and download filenames are reduced to a bare basename. The `force_fetch` fallback now honors the `BROWSE_MCP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` / `BROWSE_MCP_BLOCKED_ORIGINS` origin fence (including redirect hops). Data roots remain relocatable via `BROWSE_MCP_HOME`.
+
 ## [0.8.1] - 2026-06-12
 
 ### Added
